Per-game defaults shipped with Ambaplay.

One file per game, named <steam appid>.conf (for example 1245620.conf), in KEY=VALUE form.
`make app-payload` bundles every *.conf here into the app, and the installer copies them
to ~/Library/Application Support/ambaplay/gamefixes-default/, replacing that directory's
contents each time. Overrides belong in ~/Library/Application Support/ambaplay/gamefixes/,
which Ambaplay never touches.

Example 1245620.conf:
  # Elden Ring
  BACKEND=dxmt
